"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold leading-tight\">Standard size</span><span class=\"tabular text-caption leading-tight max-sm:text-[0.75rem] text-muted\">₹2,490</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-[5.5rem] flex-col items-start justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-md border-2 px-3 py-2 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 border-line bg-surface text-ink hover:border-graphite-light\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold leading-tight\">Made to order</span><span class=\"tabular text-caption leading-tight max-sm:text-[0.75rem] text-muted\">₹2,490</span></button></div><p class=\"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">This range is made in the size you specify. Share your dimensions with the Plusmark team.</p></fieldset><p class=\"pt-2 text-[0.75rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Demo price — not a Plusmark quotation.<!-- --> <!-- -->Sizes outside the published range are made to order.</p></div></div><aside id=\"buy-box\" class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-4 shadow-card sm:gap-5 sm:p-6 md:col-start-2 md:row-start-2 xl:col-start-3 xl:row-start-1 xl:sticky xl:top-52 xl:self-start\" aria-label=\"Buy this board\"><div><p class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">From</span><span class=\"tabular inline-flex items-baseline font-display font-bold leading-none text-ink text-[2rem]\"><span class=\"text-body-sm\">₹</span><span>2,490</span><sup class=\"text-[0.6em] font-semibold text-muted max-sm:hidden\">.<!-- -->00</sup></span><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">+ GST</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-subtle/70 p-3 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed sm:p-4 sm:text-body-sm\"><p class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Pan-India dispatch</span> from the Ahmedabad works. Freight and the delivery date are confirmed by the order desk for your PIN code.<!-- --> <a class=\"font-medium text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary\" href=\"/policies/shipping\">Shipping details</a></span></p><p class=\"mt-2 pl-[1.625rem] text-muted\">Free pickup from the Ahmedabad works.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 pl-[1.625rem] text-caption text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin size-3.5 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>Delivering to <strong class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">your PIN code</strong></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"font-medium text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline\">· Update location</button></div></div><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-body font-semibold text-ink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check size-4 text-success\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Select a size</p><p class=\"mt-1 pl-6 text-caption leading-relaxed text-muted\">Pick a size to see its price and availability.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"pdp-quantity\" class=\"text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink\">Quantity</label><select id=\"pdp-quantity\" class=\"h-11 min-w-[4.5rem] rounded-md border border-line-strong bg-surface px-2.5 text-body-sm text-ink transition-colors hover:border-muted focus-visible:border-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/25\" aria-label=\"Quantity\"><option value=\"1\" selected=\"\">1</option><option value=\"2\">2</option><option value=\"3\">3</option><option value=\"4\">4</option><option value=\"5\">5</option><option value=\"6\">6</option><option value=\"7\">7</option><option value=\"8\">8</option><option value=\"9\">9</option><option value=\"10\">10</option></select></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"h-12 w-full rounded-md bg-primary text-body-sm font-semibold text-onprimary shadow-card transition-colors hover:bg-primary-strong\">Buy Now</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"h-12 w-full rounded-md border border-line-strong bg-surface text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-subtle\">Add to cart</button><p class=\"text-center text-caption text-muted\">Total for <!-- -->1<!-- -->: <span class=\"tabular font-semibold text-ink\">₹2,490</span> + GST</p></div><dl class=\"grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 gap-y-2 rounded-xl bg-subtle/70 p-3 text-[0.75rem] sm:p-4 sm:text-caption\"><dt class=\"text-muted\">Ships from</dt><dd class=\"text-right text-ink\">Plusmark, Ahmedabad</dd><dt class=\"text-muted\">Sold by</dt><dd class=\"text-right text-ink\">Plusmark Boards</dd><dt class=\"text-muted\">GST invoice</dt><dd class=\"text-right text-ink\">With HSN</dd><dt class=\"text-muted\">Payment</dt><dd class=\"text-right text-ink\">Demo checkout — no real payment</dd></dl><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 text-caption font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-page lg:h-9 text-muted hover:text-ink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg>Add to wishlist</button><a class=\"-my-2 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-caption font-medium text-muted underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-ink lg:my-0 lg:min-h-0\" href=\"/contact\">Ask about this board</a></div><p class=\"text-[0.75rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Demo price — not a Plusmark quotation. Prices, stock and GST are confirmed by the order desk for the exact size and quantity.<!-- --> </p></aside></div></div><div class=\"pm-shell !max-w-[90rem] pb-2 pt-6\"><div class=\"sticky z-40 hidden bg-surface transition-shadow lg:block\" style=\"top:175px\"><div class=\"relative border-b border-line\"><nav aria-label=\"Product information sections\" class=\"relative flex overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar\"><a href=\"#pdp-description\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Description</a><a href=\"#pdp-features\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Key Features</a><a href=\"#pdp-specs\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Specifications</a><a href=\"#pdp-sizes\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Sizes &amp; SKUs</a><a href=\"#pdp-care\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Care &amp; Delivery</a><a href=\"#pdp-applications\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Applications</a><a href=\"#customer-reviews\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Customer reviews</a></nav><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-surface to-transparent sm:hidden\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-6 bg-gradient-to-l from-surface to-transparent sm:hidden\"></span></div></div><details open=\"\" id=\"pdp-description\" aria-labelledby=\"pdp-description-heading\" data-reveal-id=\"pdp-description\" class=\"group py-3 lg:py-7 opacity-0\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:227px\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-12 list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden lg:pointer-events-none lg:min-h-0\"><h2 id=\"pdp-description-heading\" class=\"font-display text-[1.125rem] font-extrabold leading-6 text-ink lg:text-h2 lg:leading-[1.15]\">Description</h2><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-5 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"grid gap-6 pt-4 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_20rem] lg:items-start lg:gap-10 lg:pt-5 xl:gap-16\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"relative\"><div id=\"pdp-description-body\" class=\"max-w-reading space-y-3 overflow-hidden text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-out pretty motion-reduce:transition-none\"><p>Plusmark supplies a 112-piece letter set and a 100-piece figure set. Letters are available in 12 mm, 18 mm, 24 mm and 36 mm sizes, with quantities per character as listed in Plusmark&#x27;s catalogue.</p><p>The figure set covers the digits 0–9, supplied in multiples.</p><p>Prices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.</p></div></div><ul class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-primary-soft px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium leading-none text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-factory size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-7 5V8l-7 5V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M17 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M7 18h1\"></path></svg>Made to order</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-primary-soft px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium leading-none text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 7.703 4.734a2 2 0 0 0 1.994 0L20.7 7\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path></svg>Order a single board</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-primary-soft px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium leading-none text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-receipt-text size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 8H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 12H8\"></path><path d=\"M13 16H8\"></path></svg>GST invoice</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-primary-soft px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium leading-none text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"