td><td class=\"whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 text-right\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"h-11 rounded-full border px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary lg:h-8 border-line-strong bg-surface text-ink hover:border-primary hover:text-primary-strong\">Select</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Custom sizes are made to order. Confirm the exact specification before dispatch.</p></div></details><details open=\"\" id=\"pdp-care\" aria-labelledby=\"pdp-care-heading\" data-reveal-id=\"pdp-care\" class=\"group py-3 lg:py-7 opacity-0\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:227px\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-12 list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden lg:pointer-events-none lg:min-h-0\"><h2 id=\"pdp-care-heading\" class=\"font-display text-[1.125rem] font-extrabold leading-6 text-ink lg:text-h2 lg:leading-[1.15]\">Care &amp; Delivery</h2><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-5 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"pt-4 lg:pt-5\"><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-droplets size-[1.125rem]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 16.3c2.2 0 4-1.83 4-4.05 0-1.16-.57-2.26-1.71-3.19S7.29 6.75 7 5.3c-.29 1.45-1.14 2.84-2.29 3.76S3 11.1 3 12.25c0 2.22 1.8 4.05 4 4.05z\"></path><path d=\"M12.56 6.6A10.97 10.97 0 0 0 14 3.02c.5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5s3 3.5 3 5.5a6.98 6.98 0 0 1-11.91 4.97\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold text-ink\">Care and maintenance</h3></div><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Wipe the writing surface with a dry eraser or duster after use, then a soft cloth if any ghosting remains.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Use a slightly damp cloth on chalk surfaces and let the board dry before writing again.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Avoid solvent-based or abrasive cleaners, and do not leave marker ink on the surface overnight.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Do not use a writing board as a pin surface.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck size-[1.125rem]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold text-ink\">Delivery and installation</h3></div><ul class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Boards are made to order after the size, surface and price are confirmed.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Pan-India dispatch from the Plusmark works in Ahmedabad.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Pickup from the Narolgam works carries no transport charge.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Freight and the delivery estimate for your pincode are confirmed when the invoice is raised.</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-line bg-subtle/50 px-4 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary-strong\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Not sure about the size or finish? The Plusmark order desk confirms the exact specification and price before the board goes into production.</p></div></div></details><details open=\"\" id=\"pdp-applications\" aria-labelledby=\"pdp-applications-heading\" data-reveal-id=\"pdp-applications\" class=\"group py-3 lg:py-7 opacity-0\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:227px\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-12 list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden lg:pointer-events-none lg:min-h-0\"><h2 id=\"pdp-applications-heading\" class=\"font-display text-[1.125rem] font-extrabold leading-6 text-ink lg:text-h2 lg:leading-[1.15]\">Applications</h2><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-5 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"pt-4 lg:pt-5\"><ul class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><li class=\"flex h-full gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building2 size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M10 6h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 18h4\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold leading-snug text-ink\">Reception areas</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Information and branding visible to every visitor.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex h-full gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-briefcase size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold leading-snug text-ink\">Offices</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Schedules, charts and production data on display.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex h-full gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold leading-snug text-ink\">Hotels and hospitality</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Guest information and event notices.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex h-full gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-school size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 22v-4a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v4\"></path><path d=\"m18 10 3.447 1.724a1 1 0 0 1 .553.894V20a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7.382a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894L6 10\"></path><path d=\"M18 5v17\"></path><path d=\"m4 6 7.106-3.553a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0L20 6\"></path><path d=\"M6 5v17\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold leading-snug text-ink\">Institutions</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Department boards, canteen notices and information points.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex h-full gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold leading-snug text-ink\">Coaching centres</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Batch schedules, results and announcement boards.</p></div></li><li class=\"flex h-full gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface p-4 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong\"><span class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-soft text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-house size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-body font-bold leading-snug text-ink\">Home planning</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Dry-wipe schedules and planning boards at home.</p></div></li></ul></div></details><section id=\"customer-reviews\" aria-label=\"Customer reviews for Letters and Figures Set\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 border-t border-line pt-8 lg:scroll-mt-56 lg:pt-12\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,19rem)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-14\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-[1.375rem] font-extrabold leading-7 text-ink sm:text-h2 sm:leading-[1.15]\">Customer reviews</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 pt-5\" aria-live=\"polite\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Loading customer reviews</span><div class=\"h-11 w-24 animate-pulse rounded-sm bg-subtle\"></div><div class=\"h-3 w-36 animate-pulse rounded-sm bg-subtle\"></div><div class=\"h-2.5 w-full animate-pulse rounded-sm bg-subtle\"></div><div class=\"h-2.5 w-full animate-pulse rounded-sm bg-subtle\"></div><div class=\"h-2.5 w-full animate-pulse rounded-sm bg-subtle\"></div><div class=\"h-2.5 w-full animate-pulse rounded-sm bg-subtle\"></div><div class=\"h-2.5 w-full animate-pulse rounded-sm bg-subtle\"></div></div><div class=\"pt-5\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-sans font-semibold tracking-[0.01em] transition-[background-color,color,border-color,opacity,transform] duration-200 active:scale-[0.99] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-45 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-page border border-line-strong bg-surface text-ink hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-subtle h-9 px-3 text-caption min-w-9\" href=\"/login?next=%2Fproduct%2Fletters-and-figures-set\">Sign in to write a review</a></div><p class=\"pt-4 text-caption leading-relaxed text-muted\">Reviews are written by signed-in customers on this product page. Plusmark does not seed ratings, and no review is marked as a verified purchase until server-side order records can confirm it.</p><div class=\"border-t border-line pt-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink\">Plusmark on Google</h3><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-0.5\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rated 5 out of 5\"><span class=\"relative inline-flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star absolute size-3.5 text-hair-strong\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg><span class=\"absolute