th vertically and horizontally.\\\\n\\\\nIt is used in offices, hotels and many other public places.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Finish — Black perforated board\\\",\\\"Display — Information can be shown vertically and horizontally\\\",\\\"Use — Offices, hotels and other public places\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/perforated-board\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Perforated Board - Display Board by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":1400,\\\"height\\\":1400,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":null,\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"perforated-board--standard-size\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"perforated-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-STD-DIS-STANDA\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"standard-size\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Standard size\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":null,\\\"heightCm\\\":null},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":2850,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"perforated-board--made-to-order\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"perforated-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-STD-DIS-MADETO\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"made-to-order\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Made to order\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":null,\\\"heightCm\\\":null},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":2850,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null}],\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"gstRatePercent\\\":12,\\\"hsnCode\\\":null,\\\"minimumOrderQuantity\\\":1,\\\"bulkSuggestionQuantity\\\":10,\\\"specs\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Board\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Black perforated board\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Frame\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Golden Anodized frame\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Felt colors\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Red, Maroon\\\"}],\\\"enquiryOnly\\\":false,\\\"needsData\\\":true,\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"featured\\\":false,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"acrylic-folder-display-board\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"acrylic-folder-display-board\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Acrylic Folder Display Board\\\",\\\"categoryId\\\":\\\"specialty-boards\\\",\\\"seriesId\\\":null,\\\"subcategoryIds\\\":[],\\\"surface\\\":\\\"Transparent acrylic front folders\\\",\\\"frame\\\":\\\"Strong aluminium frame\\\",\\\"corners\\\":null,\\\"magnetic\\\":false,\\\"doubleSided\\\":false,\\\"boardType\\\":\\\"n/a\\\",\\\"surfaceKind\\\":\\\"other\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"Charts, reports, SOPs and production data\\\",\\\"blurb\\\":\\\"Acrylic Folder Display Board: Transparent acrylic front folders · Strong aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The Acrylic Folder Display Board uses transparent front folders for easy document viewing. It is made for charts, reports, SOPs and production data, and papers can be inserted and replaced quickly.\\\\n\\\\nFolder size and quantity are as per customer requirement, and a strong aluminium frame makes the board suitable for industrial use.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Visibility — Transparent front folders for easy document viewing\\\",\\\"Display — Ideal for charts, reports, SOPs and production data\\\",\\\"Access — Papers can be inserted and replaced quickly\\\",\\\"Custom layout — Folder size and quantity as per customer requirement\\\",\\\"Frame — Strong aluminium frame suitable for industrial use\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":\\\"Folder size and quantity are made to customer requirement.\\\",\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/acrylic-folder-display-board\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Acrylic Folder Display Board - Specialty Display Board by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":1400,\\\"height\\\":1400,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":null,\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"acrylic-folder-display-board--standard-size\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"acrylic-folder-display-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-STD-SPE-STANDA\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"standard-size\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Standard size\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":null,\\\"heightCm\\\":null},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":2920,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"acrylic-folder-display-board--made-to-order\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"acrylic-folder-display-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-STD-SPE-MADETO\\\",\\\"size\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"made-to-order\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Made to order\\\",\\\"widthCm\\\":null,\\\"heightCm\\\":null},\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"priceInr\\\":2920,\\\"compareAtInr\\\":null,\\\"stock\\\":null,\\\"trackInventory\\\":false,\\\"available\\\":true,\\\"leadTimeDays\\\":null}],\\\"priceMode\\\":\\\"fixed\\\",\\\"gstRatePercent\\\":12,\\\"hsnCode\\\":null,\\\"minimumOrderQuantity\\\":1,\\\"bulkSuggestionQuantity\\\":10,\\\"specs\\\":[{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Folders\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Transparent front folders\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Layout\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Folder size and quantity as per customer requirement\\\"},{\\\"label\\\":\\\"Frame\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"Strong aluminium frame suitable for industrial use\\\"}],\\\"enquiryOnly\\\":false,\\\"needsData\\\":true,\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"featured\\\":false,\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"combination-board\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"combination-board\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Combination Board\\\",\\\"categoryId\\\":\\\"notice-boards\\\",\\\"seriesId\\\":null,\\\"subcategoryIds\\\":[],\\\"surface\\\":\\\"Dry wipe white board one side, fabric notice board on the other\\\",\\\"frame\\\":null,\\\"corners\\\":null,\\\"magnetic\\\":false,\\\"doubleSided\\\":false,\\\"boardType\\\":\\\"n/a\\\",\\\"surfaceKind\\\":\\\"pin-up\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"Marker writing and pin-up display in one board\\\",\\\"blurb\\\":\\\"Combination Board: Dry wipe white board one side, fabric notice board on the other. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The Combination Board carries a dry wipe white board on one side and a fabric notice board on the other, so marker writing and pin-up display sit in a single board.\\\\n\\\\nThe marker face erases cleanly, while the durable fabric takes repeated pinning and removal without losing grip. It is available in Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants.\\\\n\\\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\\\",\\\"features\\\":[\\\"Surface — Dry wipe white board on one side, fabric notice board on the other\\\",\\\"Function — Marker writing plus pin-up display in a single board\\\",\\\"Performance — Smooth marker writing with easy erase and a durable fabric surface for repeated pin use\\\",\\\"Durability — Long-lasting surface performance for regular notice display\\\",\\\"Design options — Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants\\\"],\\\"customisation\\\":null,\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"publicId\\\":\\\"plusmark/products/combination-board\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Combination Board - Notice Board by Plusmark\\\",\\\"width\\\":1400,\\\"height\\\":1400,\\\"source\\\":\\\"product\\\"}],\\\"videoId\\\":null,\\\"variants\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"combination-board--standard-size\\\",\\\"productId\\\":\\\"combination-board\\\",\\\"sku\\\":\\\"PM-STD-NOT-STANDA\\\",\\\