Regular notice display with repeated pin use\",\"blurb\":\"Cork Notice Board: High-quality natural cork. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Cork Notice Board uses a high-quality natural cork surface over a soft, resilient base built for smooth pin insertion and firm holding. It allows frequent pinning and removal without surface damage or loss of grip.\\n\\nThe uniform cork texture gives a neat, professional appearance, and the surface is long-lasting for regular notice display. It is available in Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — High-quality natural cork suitable for repeated pin use\",\"Core — Soft and resilient base for smooth pin insertion and firm holding\",\"Performance — Frequent pinning and removal without surface damage or loss of grip\",\"Finish — Uniform cork texture with a neat and professional appearance\",\"Durability — Long-lasting performance for regular notice display\",\"Design options — Metallic Premium, Eco Premium and Deluxe frame variants\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/cork-notice-board\",\"alt\":\"Cork Notice Board - Notice Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"cork-notice-board--standard-size\",\"productId\":\"cork-notice-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-STD-NOT-STANDA\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"standard-size\",\"label\":\"Standard size\",\"widthCm\":null,\"heightCm\":null},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3070,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"cork-notice-board--made-to-order\",\"productId\":\"cork-notice-b